 "notes": "The River Flame on the Known World (blend xy, 1 unit = 10 miles, +x east, +y north). The trunk and the delta arms are the centrelines of KnownWorld.blend's RIVER_river_flame (read only); the two main arms branch from the trunk at y 69.9 here, just north of Haven's patch (the blend forks at y 66, under the patch). Atlas.Core.FlameValleyRegion paints the river silt-red, lays irrigated fields and canals on both banks from the Varduun foothills to the delta, and places farming villages and market towns. Town names are placeholders (LORE?). The belt swells round Haven (the outer enclosure's canal country, as wide as Haven's own plinth at its 6x miniature).",
